NAME
    gcloud alpha network-services agent-gateways - manage Network Services
        AgentGateways

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha network-services agent-gateways COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Manage Network Services AgentGateways.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     delete
        (ALPHA) Delete an AgentGateway.

     describe
        (ALPHA) Describe a Agent Gateway.

     export
        (ALPHA) Export an AgentGateway.

     import
        (ALPHA) Import an AgentGateway.

     list
        (ALPHA) List AgentGateways.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist. This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud beta network-services agent-gateways

